{
  "info": {
    "name": "WorkDesk24 Task Management APIs",
    "description": "Task Management endpoints. BASE_URL, TOKEN, ADMIN_TOKEN, and ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN are resolved from the active Postman environment. Admin requests also require the matching admin CSRF cookie from the admin authentication flow. Run Create Task before requests that use TASK_ID; IDs are saved from successful responses. JSON requests use application/json. Attachment uploads use multipart/form-data so Postman can generate the required boundary.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "workdesk24-task-management-v1"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Admin APIs",
      "description": "Admin-only routes under /api/v1/admin/tasks. Uses ADMIN_TOKEN and requires admin CSRF validation.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{ADMIN_TOKEN}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "prerequest",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "const csrf = pm.environment.get('ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN');",
            "const cookieName = pm.environment.get('ADMIN_CSRF_COOKIE_NAME') || 'wd24_admin_csrf';",
            "if (csrf) pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Cookie', value: cookieName + '=' + csrf });"
          ]
        }
      }],
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Task",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Prepare customer proposal\",\n  \"description\": \"Draft and review the proposal\",\n  \"assignedToUserId\": 22,\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n  \"dueAt\": 1791853200\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/createTask", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "createTask"] },
            "description": "Creates a PENDING task and its CREATED activity log. Replace assignedToUserId with an active field-app user in this tenant. data.task.taskNumber is generated automatically from the authenticated host's settings (default TASK-1, TASK-2, ...). Do not send hostId or taskNumber. A trailing hyphen in the stored prefix is used as the separator; otherwise a hyphen is added. Task, activity log, and counter advancement commit together; failures do not consume a number. Existing host prefixes and counters are preserved."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const result = pm.response.json();", "if (result.success && result.data && result.data.task && result.data.task.id) pm.environment.set('TASK_ID', result.data.task.id);", "pm.test('Created task includes an automatic task number', function () { pm.expect(result.success).to.eql(true); pm.expect(result.data.task.taskNumber).to.be.a('string').and.match(/.+-[1-9][0-9]*$/); pm.expect(Array.from(result.data.task.taskNumber).length).to.be.at.most(30); });"] } }],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Task With Attachment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "title", "value": "Prepare customer proposal", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description", "value": "Draft and review the proposal", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "assignedToUserId", "value": "22", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "priority", "value": "HIGH", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "dueAt", "value": "1791853200", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "customerId", "value": "31", "type": "text", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "visitId", "value": "41", "type": "text", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "remarks", "value": "Proposal reference", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/createTaskWithAttachment", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "createTaskWithAttachment"] },
            "description": "Requires the inherited admin bearer token and matching CSRF cookie/header. Send task fields directly as multipart text fields. title and assignedToUserId are required; description, customerId, visitId, priority, dueAt (Unix seconds), attachment remarks, and the file are optional. Omit the file part to create a task without an attachment, or include one validated JPEG, PNG, WEBP, or PDF file up to 10 MB under file. Do not set Content-Type manually. Returns data.task and includes data.attachment only when a file is uploaded. The server links the attachment to the newly created task; do not send taskId or taskCommentId. Task, activity, counter, and attachment metadata commit together; failures roll back and attempt uploaded-file cleanup. Notifications run only after commit. The separate creation and upload endpoints remain available."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const result = pm.response.json();", "if (result.success && result.data && result.data.task) pm.environment.set('TASK_ID', result.data.task.id);", "if (result.success && result.data && result.data.attachment) pm.environment.set('ATTACHMENT_ID', result.data.attachment.id);", "pm.test('Task is created and attachment is optional', function () { pm.expect(result.success).to.eql(true); pm.expect(result.data.task).to.be.an('object'); if (result.data.attachment) pm.expect(String(result.data.attachment.taskId)).to.eql(String(result.data.task.id)); });"] } }],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Tasks",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"filters\": {\n    \"status\": \"PENDING\",\n    \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n    \"search\": \"proposal\",\n    \"overdueOnly\": false\n  },\n  \"page\": 1,\n  \"limit\": 20,\n  \"sortBy\": \"createdAt\",\n  \"sortOrder\": \"DESC\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/getTasks", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "getTasks"] },
            "description": "Filters also support assignedToUserId, createdByUserId, customerId, visitId, dueDate and completedDate. Date filters are optional YYYY-MM-DD or DD/MM/YYYY strings, for example filters: { dueDate: '2026-10-23', completedDate: '23/10/2026' }. Formats can be mixed in one request. Each date is interpreted in the authenticated client's configured host timezone (HostSettings timezone), the same timezone used for response formatting, and converted to inclusive start/end-of-day Unix seconds for dueAt/completedAt comparisons, including DST. Both filters combine with AND. Omit unused date filters; null, timestamps and invalid dates return HTTP 400. Legacy dueFrom/dueTo Unix-second bounds remain supported but cannot be combined with dueDate. Success retains { success, message, data: { tasks, pagination } }."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Task Details",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"taskId\": {{TASK_ID}}\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/getTaskDetails", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "getTaskDetails"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Task",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"taskId\": {{TASK_ID}},\n  \"title\": \"Prepare revised customer proposal\",\n  \"description\": \"Update the pricing section and review\",\n  \"priority\": \"URGENT\",\n  \"dueAt\": 1791856800\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/updateTask", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "updateTask"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Assign or Reassign Task",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"taskId\": {{TASK_ID}},\n  \"assignedToUserId\": 22\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/assignTask", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "assignTask"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Start Task",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"taskId\": {{TASK_ID}}\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/startTask", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "startTask"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Complete Task",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"taskId\": {{TASK_ID}},\n  \"remarks\": \"Proposal sent to the customer\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/completeTask", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "completeTask"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel Task",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"taskId\": {{TASK_ID}},\n  \"remarks\": \"Customer postponed the request\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/cancelTask", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "cancelTask"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Task Activity",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"taskId\": {{TASK_ID}},\n  \"page\": 1,\n  \"limit\": 20\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/getTaskActivity", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "getTaskActivity"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Task Comment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"taskId\": {{TASK_ID}},\n  \"comment\": \"Please confirm the final pricing before sending.\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/addTaskComment", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "addTaskComment"] }
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const result = pm.response.json();", "if (result.success && result.data && result.data.comment && result.data.comment.id) pm.environment.set('COMMENT_ID', result.data.comment.id);"] } }],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Task Comment With Attachment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "formdata", "formdata": [
              { "key": "taskId", "value": "{{TASK_ID}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "comment", "value": "Please review the attached proposal.", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "remarks", "value": "Proposal evidence", "type": "text", "disabled": true },
              { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [], "disabled": true }
            ] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/addTaskCommentWithAttachment", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "addTaskCommentWithAttachment"] },
            "description": "Creates a task comment and optionally its linked attachment atomically. Requires taskId and comment (1-5000 characters). Omit the file part to add a comment without an attachment, or include one JPEG, PNG, WEBP, or PDF file up to 10 MB. Optional remarks: up to 500 characters. Uses inherited ADMIN_TOKEN bearer authentication and the matching admin CSRF cookie/header. Postman sets the multipart Content-Type boundary. Success always returns data.comment and includes data.attachment only when a file is uploaded; attachment.taskCommentId is the newly created comment ID. Uploaded media is deleted if persistence fails."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const result = pm.response.json();", "if (result.success && result.data) {", "  if (result.data.comment && result.data.comment.id) pm.environment.set('COMMENT_ID', result.data.comment.id);", "  if (result.data.attachment && result.data.attachment.id) pm.environment.set('ATTACHMENT_ID', result.data.attachment.id);", "}"] } }],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Task Comments",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"taskId\": {{TASK_ID}},\n  \"page\": 1,\n  \"limit\": 20\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/getTaskComments", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "getTaskComments"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload Task Attachment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "formdata", "formdata": [
              { "key": "taskId", "value": "{{TASK_ID}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "taskCommentId", "value": "{{COMMENT_ID}}", "type": "text", "disabled": true },
              { "key": "remarks", "value": "Proposal attachment", "type": "text", "disabled": true },
              { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [] }
            ] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/uploadTaskAttachment", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "uploadTaskAttachment"] },
            "description": "Choose a JPEG, PNG, WEBP, or PDF file no larger than 10 MB. Postman will set the multipart Content-Type with its boundary. The response data.attachment.fileName preserves normal filename characters and replaces path separators and control characters. Open data.attachment.fileUrl exactly as returned, including its authenticated Cloudinary signature and file extension. Cloudinary must allow PDF delivery in the account security settings."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const result = pm.response.json();", "if (result.success && result.data && result.data.attachment && result.data.attachment.id) pm.environment.set('ATTACHMENT_ID', result.data.attachment.id);"] } }],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Task Attachments",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"taskId\": {{TASK_ID}},\n  \"page\": 1,\n  \"limit\": 20\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/getTaskAttachments", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "getTaskAttachments"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Task Attachment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "x-csrf-token", "value": "{{ADMIN_CSRF_TOKEN}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"taskId\": {{TASK_ID}},\n  \"attachmentId\": {{ATTACHMENT_ID}}\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/tasks/getTaskAttachment", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "tasks", "getTaskAttachment"] }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "App APIs",
      "description": "Employee task routes under /api/v1/app/task. Uses TOKEN from the active Postman environment. Employees can only access tasks assigned to them.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{TOKEN}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List My Tasks",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"filters\": {\n    \"status\": \"PENDING\",\n    \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n    \"search\": \"proposal\",\n    \"overdueOnly\": false\n  },\n  \"page\": 1,\n  \"limit\": 20,\n  \"sortBy\": \"createdAt\",\n  \"sortOrder\": \"DESC\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/app/task/getTasks", "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "app", "task", "getTasks"] },
            "description": "Uses inherited employee bearer authentication. Optional filters.dueDate and filters.completedDate accept YYYY-MM-DD or DD/MM/YYYY, for example 2026-10-23 or 23/10/2026. Formats can be mixed in one request. The server uses the client's configured host timezone (HostSettings timezone) to compare inclusive local-day Unix-second bounds against dueAt/completedAt. Both filters combine with AND; omit unused filters. Invalid dates and null return HTTP 400. Legacy dueFrom/dueTo Unix bounds remain supported but cannot be combined with dueDate. Employees still see only their assigned tasks. Success retains { success, message, data: { tasks, pagination } }."
          },
          "response": []
        },
